  m_Name: Evento_FugaParaOsSuburbios
  m_EditorClassIdentifier: Metis.Runtime::KnowledgeEntryData
  _title: "Fuga para os Sub\xFArbios"
  _titleEn: Flight to the Suburbs
  _category: 1
  _unlockTrigger: 0
  _summary: "Fam\xEDlias de renda mais alta deixam o centro por condom\xEDnios afastados,
    levando arrecada\xE7\xE3o e aumentando as viagens de carro."
  _summaryEn: Higher-income families leave the center for distant gated communities,
    taking revenue with them and increasing car trips.
  _realWorld: "Alphaville, em Barueri, lan\xE7ado nos anos 1970, virou o modelo dos
    condom\xEDnios fechados brasileiros, com moradores que v\xE3o de carro todo dia
    at\xE9 S\xE3o Paulo."
  _realWorldEn: "Alphaville, in Barueri, launched in the 1970s, became the model
    for Brazilian gated communities, with residents who drive to S\xE3o Paulo every
    day."
  _tradeOffs: O centro esvaziado se degrada, e a cidade espalhada custa mais para
    levar infraestrutura.
  _tradeOffsEn: The emptied center decays, and the sprawling city costs more to serve
    with infrastructure.
  _sources:
  - Label: "Alphaville (Wikip\xE9dia)"
    Url: https://pt.wikipedia.org/wiki/Alphaville_(Barueri)
